    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Dheriga Wax Lagu Kariyo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo haddana Eraygii Rabbiga ayaa ii yimid sannaddii sagaalaad, bisheedii tobnaad, maalinteedii tobnaad, isagoo leh, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wiilka Aadamow, maalintan, xataa isla maantadan qudheeda magaceeda qor, waayo, boqorkii Baabuloon isla maantadan qudheeda ayuu Yeruusaalem ku soo dhowaaday. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo reerka caasiyoobay waxaad kula hadashaa masaal, oo waxaad ku tidhaahdaa, Sayidka Rabbiga ahu wuxuu leeyahay, Dheriga dabka saara, saara oo biyo ku shuba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waxaad ku gurtaan cadcadka, xataa cadcadka wanwanaagsan oo dhan, oo ah bowdada iyo garabka, oo waxaad ka buuxisaan lafaha ugu wacan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waxaad soo wadataan adhiga jarkiisa, oo waxaad hoostiisa ku gurtaan lafaha, oo si wanaagsan u kariya, oo lafihiisana ku dhex kariya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sidaas daraaddeed Sayidka Rabbiga ahu wuxuu leeyahay, Waxaa iska hoogtay magaalada dhiigga qabta, taasoo ah dheriga miridhkiisu ku jiro, oo aan miridhkiisu ka bixin! Cadcad u soo bixiya, iyadoo aan saami lagu bixin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waayo, dhiiggeedii dhexdeeduu yaal. Waxay kor saartay dhagax diiran, oo dhulkana kuma ay daadin si ay ciid ugu daboosho aawadeed. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inay cadho ugu soo kacdo oo ay ka aarsato ayaan dhiiggeedii dhagax diiran dul saaray si uusan u daboolmin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sidaas daraaddeed Sayidka Rabbiga ahu wuxuu leeyahay, Waxaa iska hoogtay magaalada dhiigga qabta! Aniguna tuulmada waan weynayn doonaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoryo ku sii gur, oo dabka sii shid, oo hilibka aad u kari, oo maraqana xawaash ku shub, oo lafuhuna ha gubteen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaas dheriga oo madhan dhuxusha shidan saar si uu u kululaado, oo ay naxaastiisu u gubato, oo ay wasakhdiisu gudihiisa ugu dhalaasho oo uu miridhkiisuna u baabba'o. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iyadu si aan waxba tarayn ayay isu daalisay, oo miridhkeeda badanna iyada kama uu baxo, oo miridhkeeda dabka kagama baxo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wasakhdaada shar baa ku jira, maxaa yeelay, waan ku nadiifiyey laakiinse waad nadiifsanaan weyday, haddaba innaba wasakhdaada kama aad nadiifsami doontid jeeraan cadhadayda kugu dhammaystiro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aniga Rabbiga ah ayaa saas ku hadlay. Saasay noqon doontaa, oo taasaan samayn doonaa. Innaba dib ugama aan noqon doono, mana tudhi doono, oo innaba kama aan soo noqon doono. Siday jidadkaagu ahaayeen iyo siday falimahaagu ahaayeen ayay kuu xukumi doonaan ayaa Sayidka Rabbiga ahu leeyahay.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Afadii Yexesqeel Oo Dhimatay",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo haddana Eraygii Rabbiga ayaa ii yimid isagoo leh, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wiilka Aadamow, bal ogow, waxaan darbad qudha kaaga qaadayaa tii ay indhahaagu jecel yihiin, laakiinse ha u barooran, hana u ooyin, oo ilmadaaduna innaba yaanay u daadan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Taah, laakiin si aamusan u taah, oo baroorasho kuwii dhintay loo baroorto ha u barooran. Duubkaaga madaxa ku duubo, oo kabaha gasho, oo bushimahaagana ha daboolin, oo kibista dadkana innaba ha cunin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaan aroortii dadkii la hadlay, makhribkiina naagtaydii way dhimatay, oo aniguna sidii laygu amray ayaan subaxdii yeelay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo markaasaa dadkii waxay igu yidhaahdeen, War maad noo sheegtid waxan aad samaynaysid ulajeeddadooda? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaan ugu jawaabay, Eraygii Rabbiga ayaa ii yimid isagoo leh, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Reer binu Israa'iil la hadal, oo waxaad ku tidhaahdaa, Sayidka Rabbiga ahu wuxuu leeyahay, Bal ogaada, meeshayda quduuska ah ayaan nijaasayn doonaa, taasoo ah faankii xooggiinna iyo waxa ay indhihiinnu jecel yihiin, iyo waxa ay naftiinnu u naxdo; oo wiilashiinna iyo gabdhihiinna aad ka tagteenna seef bay ku le'an doonaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo idinkuna sidaan yeelay oo kale ayaad yeeli doontaan. Bushimihiinna ma aad dabooli doontaan, oo kibista dadkana ma aad cuni doontaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo duubabkiinnu madaxay idiinku duubnaan doonaan, oo kabihiinnuna cagahay idiinku jiri doonaan. Ma aad barooran doontaan, mana aad ooyi doontaan, laakiinse xumaatooyinkiinna baad la macaluuli doontaan, oo midkiinba kan kaluu ku musannaabi doonaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sidaasuu Yexesqeel calaamad idiinku ahaan doonaa, oo wax alla wixii uu sameeyey ayaad idinkuna samayn doontaan. Oo markay waxaasu dhacaan ayaad ogaan doontaan inaan anigu ahay Sayidka Rabbiga ah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo weliba Wiilka Aadamow, maalinta aan iyaga ka qaado xooggooda, iyo farxadda sharaftooda, iyo waxa ay indhahoodu jecel yihiin, iyo waxa uu qalbigoodu raaco, iyo wiilashooda iyo gabdhahoodaba, soo noqon maayo ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "in kii soo baxsaday uu maalintaas kuu iman doono inuu dhegahaaga wixii dhacay oo dhan kugu maqashiiyo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo maalintaas qudheeda ayaa afkaagu kii soo baxsaday u furmi doonaa, oo waad hadli doontaa, oo mar dambena ma aad carrab la'aan doontid. Sidaasaad calaamad u noqon doontaa, oo iyaguna waxay ogaan doonaan inaan anigu Rabbiga ahay.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
